# Locator Strategy

Project uses custom test attribute: data-test

Always use:

page.getByTestId('value')

Never use:

page.locator('[data-test="value"]')

Reason:

- better readability
- Playwright optimized
- more stable abstraction

Example:

Bad:
page.locator('[data-test="login-submit"]')

Good:
page.getByTestId('login-submit')
